Here's an idea that I'm going to try hacking into my nethack code --
gloves of shocking.  The idea is that when you are wearing them, they
give whatever weapon you are wielding extra damage points from electric
shock.  I think that, as a balance, I will also cause them to do damage
the player if he/she doesn't have shock resistance.  That way, they
could start off cursed, but become useful later on if retained.

Now that I think about it, the weapon should also have to be metallic in
nature, i.e., no clubs, rubber hoses, etc.  Obviously, missle weapons are
also excluded.

